  "short_description": "Scrub in as a field surgeon in a plague-ridden free city at war. Humans, dwarves, elves, orcs, hornfolk and giants come to your table. Draw arrows from bone, close sabre cuts, saw shattered limbs, and face the Malison: a curse that fights back from inside your patients.",
